# Byte-compiled / optimized / DLL files
# No trailing slash: the pattern has to match a stray FILE called __pycache__
# as well as the directory. One was committed once, and because it occupied the
# name Python needed for the directory, the interpreter could not cache bytecode
# for the package at all.
__pycache__
*.py[codz]
*$py.class

# C extensions
*.so

